<title>UK: Polypipe lifts year pretax profits 11.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Polypipe lifts year pretax profits 11.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		11.9		   vs 10.75</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 2.14		   vs 1.85</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 2.97		   vs 2.66</p>
<p> Pretax		     28.5		   vs 25.5</p>
<p> Turnover		   208.7		  vs 191.4</p>
<p> Operating profit	 29.4		   vs 26.1</p>
<p> Interest payable	 0.9		    vs 0.6</p>
<p> Tax			  9.7		    vs 8.6</p>
<p> Net taxed		  18.8		   vs 16.9</p>
<p> Retained		   14.1		   vs 12.7</p>
<p> Pay date		   November 27</p>
<p>Div registration date  October 8  Ex-div date		September 30</p>
<p>NOTE - Plastic pipes and fittings maker Polypipe Plc said it is well placed to take advantage of any overall improvement in market conditions when they occur.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717.</p>
</text>
